WEBVTT

00:00:14.512 --> 00:00:15.342
<v><b>B:</b></v> Sorry I’m late.

00:00:16.587 --> 00:00:17.456
<v><b>M:</b></v> Don’t worry, Ben.

00:00:17.822 --> 00:00:18.935
We haven’t ordered yet.

00:00:19.453 --> 00:00:20.547
We were waiting for you.

00:00:23.521 --> 00:00:26.255
You have something on your tie.

00:00:27.666 --> 00:00:29.028
<v><b>B:</b></v> I do? Oh.

00:00:31.255 --> 00:00:32.061
It’s from work.

00:00:32.842 --> 00:00:33.340
Thanks.

00:00:47.866 --> 00:00:49.267
<v><b>W:</b></v> Are you ready to order?

00:00:49.331 --> 00:00:50.112
<v><b>M:</b></v> Yes, please.

00:00:50.771 --> 00:00:52.085
<v><b>W:</b></v> Can I get you something to start with?

00:00:52.944 --> 00:00:53.462
<v><b>M:</b></v> OK.

00:00:53.476 --> 00:00:55.324
Do we want starters?

00:00:57.145 --> 00:00:57.780
No, thank you.

00:00:59.938 --> 00:01:01.662
I’d like the tuna.

00:01:02.634 --> 00:01:05.632
<v><b>W:</b></v> Would you like that with salad or chips?

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.116
<v><b>M:</b></v> Salad, please.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:09.924
<v><b>W:</b></v> And for you?

00:01:10.754 --> 00:01:12.229
<v><b>I:</b></v> I’ll have the steak, please.

00:01:13.020 --> 00:01:14.352
<v><b>W:</b></v> How would you like your steak?

00:01:14.577 --> 00:01:16.540
Rare, medium, or well done?

00:01:17.082 --> 00:01:17.585
<v><b>I:</b></v> Rare.

00:01:19.421 --> 00:01:20.354
<v><b>W:</b></v> And for you?

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:35.336
The tuna for you, the steak for you.

00:01:35.683 --> 00:01:36.962
The other dishes are coming.

00:01:37.289 --> 00:01:38.163
<v><b>M:</b></v> Excuse me.

00:01:38.649 --> 00:01:40.932
I asked for salad, not chips.

00:01:41.435 --> 00:01:43.037
<v><b>W:</b></v> Oh, I’m sorry.

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:45.258
No problem, I’ll change it.

00:01:45.502 --> 00:01:46.078
<v><b>M:</b></v> Thank you.

00:01:47.846 --> 00:01:48.569
<v><b>I:</b></v> Excuse me.

00:01:48.925 --> 00:01:49.281
<v><b>W:</b></v> Yes?

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:52.675
<v><b>I:</b></v> I asked for my steak rare, and this is medium.

00:01:54.443 --> 00:01:55.800
<v><b>W:</b></v> I’m really sorry.

00:01:56.166 --> 00:01:57.904
I’ll take it back to the kitchen.

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:12.050
<v><b>M:</b></v> Can we have the bill, please?

00:02:12.421 --> 00:02:13.046
<v><b>W:</b></v> Of course.

00:02:32.636 --> 00:02:34.267
<v><b>M:</b></v> I think there’s a mistake here.

00:02:34.374 --> 00:02:36.541
I had the salad, not chips.

00:02:36.542 --> 00:02:37.895
And Izzy had the steak.

00:02:38.813 --> 00:02:40.355
<v><b>W:</b></v> I’m very sorry.

00:02:40.356 --> 00:02:41.210
I’ll change that.